WEBVTT

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.430
So, you finally show up?

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:24.700
But you always take your time.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.560
Why did you disappear?

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:38.630
Jill is mine!

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.330
Nobody can have Hatsumi!

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:42.660
It's Eve and she's mine!

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:44.300
No, it's Jill and she's mine!

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.900
It's Eve!

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:48.460
It's getting interesting.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:52.530
Let's sit back and watch
while I drink my sake to that.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:58.100
I want to see you but I can't
see you because it hurts so much.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:02.260
I'm sure I must
be missing something...

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:05.500
...and that's why my
prayer hasn't been answered.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:09.600
(Yami, the Hat and the Book traveler)
...and that's why my
prayer hasn't been answered.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:16.530
I had always believed
that what I saw before me...

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:23.330
...was the only truth there was.

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:31.160
But now I know
there isn't just one world.

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:40.630
There are a thousand worlds called
"if" and I don't know which way to turn.

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:46.530
I want to see you but
I can't see you; where are you now?

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:49.660
I'll find you no matter the cost.

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:57.430
I've wandered into the
labyrinth of your eyes.

00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:01.430
Even if the darkness bars my path...

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:07.430
...even if my weak heart
is led astray, I won't give up.

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:12.400
I'll keep searching for you.

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:27.500
- I'm telling you both, that's Eve.
- I won't listen to you! She's mine!

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.300
Gargantua
- I'm telling you both, that's Eve.
- I won't listen to you! She's mine!

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:32.530
Please, don't fight!

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:34.530
Listen to me!

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:36.860
Shut up!

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:40.830
This is awful!

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:42.430
I can't let you have her!

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:44.230
I'll take her with
me no matter what!

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.060
Stop it!

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:55.360
Hatsumi.

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:57.400
I'm so sorry.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.460
This is all my fault.

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:04.530
So, please stop fighting.

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:08.500
I'm, I'm...

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.460
Are you going to return to
the world where you belong?

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:34.560
No way!

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:42.000
Then, take this
as a farewell gift.

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:09.930
I'm back in my world.

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:13.260
Hatsumi, Hatsumi!

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:19.960
Why did she leave me again?

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:22.260
Hold on.

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:28.430
Why do you want to keep her?

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:32.530
So I can become an
omnipotent god, obviously.

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:34.260
It's not for redemption?

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:43.600
You could say that, but I will
make Jill, I mean Eve, the wife of a god.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.060
Do you love her?

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:49.100
Sure, I've loved her
for hundreds of years.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:51.700
If you truly love her,
then set her free.

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:57.930
If you are meant to be
together, you will meet again.

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:02.160
Are you telling me to
give up? Foolishness!

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:03.200
You're the fool.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.000
What?

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:08.330
Hey, why do you
want to marry Mau?

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:14.700
She took care of
your wound, didn't she?

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:17.260
That really touched you, right?

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:21.030
That's the way it is, master.

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:25.430
Guriel is the dumbest of us three
but he can still take care of himself.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:30.530
But this time, he couldn't.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:36.760
He couldn't bandage his own hand!

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:39.660
What does it have to do with anything?

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:41.500
She help me, good!

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:48.400
It still hurts, but Mau help me, good.

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:55.400
I know it's gonna be okay
but I love Mau, very much.

00:05:57.630 --> 00:05:59.700
He understands love very well.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.960
It cures all wounds after all.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:06.860
What's the point of hurting each other?

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:11.530
You always hurt.

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:14.600
Right here.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.060
You're worse than a fool.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:25.260
There's something I have to do.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:37.760
This is...?

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:49.230
Jill?

00:07:07.730 --> 00:07:09.630
Jill, I...

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.230
The birdie died.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:33.500
It was singing to me
in such a sweet voice.

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:43.060
Ritsuko.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:44.460
Where's Ritsuko?

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:56.360
Ritsuko, it's me,
do you remember me?

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:01.700
Gargantua.

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:06.460
It's because of me...
that you had to go through this.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.600
I...

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:20.730
Is this okay, Jill?

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:53.260
Come here.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:06.760
This is our world... from this day on.

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:12.130
We will live here together,
forever, okay Ritsuko?

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:20.760
You feel so warm.

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:23.060
I feel it, too.

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:26.230
I've never felt
this peaceful before.

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:47.800
And they live
happily ever after, I guess.

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:52.630
But, now I don't have
a drinking buddy around.

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:55.100
I feel lonely.

00:10:58.430 --> 00:11:00.300
Now, let's
celebrate your marriage!

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:01.230
Drink up!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:30.430
Hatsumi, where are you?

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:31.530
Hatsumi!

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:39.500
Hatsumi.

00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:46.830
Hatsumi, let's go.

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:47.930
Where?

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:50.100
I don't care as
long as you're with me.

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:58.460
Wait Hazuki,
you're going too fast!

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:05.700
I'm sorry.

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:11.730
I was too afraid to let
somebody take you away again.

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:15.430
Nobody will take me away.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:19.030
It's just you and me here.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:24.230
I am sorry, Hazuki.

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:28.160
I should have explained
everything to you sooner.

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:29.600
Why?

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:33.060
Why can you speak?

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:35.830
That's right...

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:43.700
I've never talked before but we
were able to communicate without words.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:51.460
I always knew what you wanted to
say and you knew what I wanted to say...

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:53.330
Better than anybody else did.

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:05.060
Let's go back.

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:09.160
Let's go home.

00:13:15.030 --> 00:13:16.000
I'm so sorry.

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:18.400
Hatsumi?

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:20.360
I'm so sorry.

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:27.260
This is the real me.

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:33.560
I won't change again but I
can never go back as Hatsumi.

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:35.830
You are Hatsumi!

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:42.560
Not anymore.

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:45.030
My real name is Eve.

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:52.360
I have had many lives but it's
time for me to go back to my true self.

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:53.830
No, I don't believe that!

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:03.800
You're Hatsumi!

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:12.130
Please Hazuki, stop it!

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:19.230
Hatsumi.

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:24.900
Let's go home together.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:30.930
Hazuki.

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.860
I don't know if anybody
has ever loved me so much.

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:38.630
I wish I could go back with you...

00:14:38.630 --> 00:14:42.360
...but that's something that can
never happen, please understand!

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:47.230
In that case, I will kill you and
then kill myself so we can be together!

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:55.430
I see.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.160
Do as you wish.

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:15.860
Hatsumi!

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:23.460
A shooting star?

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:28.030
The tears of a star...

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.300
A star's tears?

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:32.730
Is someone crying?

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:35.960
Two shooting stars.

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:39.530
Two hearts must be weeping.

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:57.100
Hatsumi, I'm so sorry.

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.160
It's okay.

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:08.860
I can't... live without you, Hatsumi.

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.400
Hatsumi! Hatsumi!

00:16:13.230 --> 00:16:14.260
Hatsumi!

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:16.130
Please come back!

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:24.930
Hazuki, let's believe that we will
meet again sometime in the future.

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:32.200
No matter how far apart we are,
our hearts will be together...

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:35.260
...and we can
hear each other's voices.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.030
I love you.

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:47.430
No matter where I go,
I will never forget you.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:58.500
Eve... let's go back.

00:16:58.860 --> 00:17:01.130
Yes, we should go back now.

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:21.460
This is my true form.

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:23.500
Look closely.

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:26.930
And never forget me.

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.430
Hatsumi!

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:45.530
I won't say good bye because I will
come back someday, as your child.

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:55.960
Sis.

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:04.600
I will come back
someday as your child.

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:33.100
Lilith can't go home.

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:38.700
Eve!

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:40.230
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:18:40.230 --> 00:18:41.530
You always do this!

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:48.760
You leave me behind and
have all the fun without me!

00:18:49.030 --> 00:18:50.460
I'm sorry, sis.

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:54.400
You think apologizing
will make things better?!

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:57.230
I'm sorry.

00:18:57.560 --> 00:18:58.460
I'm really sorry.

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:06.900
Don't worry, I won't
go anywhere anymore.

00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:09.800
I will always be with
you from now on, sis.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:12.800
Really?

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:14.100
Really.

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:16.430
That's a lie!

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:21.960
It's a promise.

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:33.400
I think everybody's happy now but me.

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:36.560
I feel like the only one alone.

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:43.660
Oh, no!

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:49.530
Help me!

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:53.360
Can somebody stop
staring and help me?

00:19:57.860 --> 00:19:59.060
It's hot!

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:00.360
I'm burning!

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:15.760
Oh my!

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:19.130
I hope they fall
into a lake or something.

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:21.730
I'll go find them.

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:27.700
I am coming, everybody!

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.330
They're so lucky.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.930
Sounds like
everybody's having fun.

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:38.230
Intruder!

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:40.800
I felt something.

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:48.200
Oh my.

00:20:51.760 --> 00:20:54.500
How could you stab me like that?

00:20:55.030 --> 00:20:56.630
What were you doing?

00:20:57.230 --> 00:21:00.500
I was trying to fix the house.

00:21:02.300 --> 00:21:06.730
I kind of like it this way,
so no need to fix it.

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:10.860
Then, I will excuse myself
and take care of the damage.

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:12.960
Wait up.

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:16.730
That's not a serious wound,
but alcohol can do it some good.

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:19.500
Show me your cute little butt.

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:20.860
No thanks, I'm fine.

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:22.100
Don't give me that.

00:21:22.660 --> 00:21:27.130
Your lips say 'no' but
your body says otherwise.

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:35.860
Let's be honest about each
other's desires and have a fun time.

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:53.260
I will offer up an eternal prayer.

00:21:53.530 --> 00:21:59.700
I will never give up on what matters.

00:22:02.530 --> 00:22:07.160
I will go there, praying.

00:22:07.730 --> 00:22:14.000
No matter the distance
between us, I will catch you.

00:22:14.260 --> 00:22:21.830
That's a promise between you and I.

00:22:22.030 --> 00:22:29.160
Crying, cradling my memories,...

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:35.660
...won't help even one
of my feelings to reach you.

00:22:37.260 --> 00:22:44.700
I will offer up an eternal prayer.

00:22:44.900 --> 00:22:51.330
I will never give up on what matters.

00:22:53.300 --> 00:23:00.230
I will find the dawn
between you and I,...

00:23:01.030 --> 00:23:08.660
...and meet the approaching daybreak.

00:23:09.160 --> 00:23:13.900
I will go there, praying.

00:23:15.100 --> 00:23:19.060
That was a fun
journey but it's over now.

00:23:20.360 --> 00:23:22.130
Now then, let's
look at the next book.

00:23:31.500 --> 00:23:36.300
When... I wondered how
long this happiness would last,

00:23:38.030 --> 00:23:42.200
I was so sad... I wanted to cry.

00:23:49.760 --> 00:23:53.160
Next Time: Lilith
Yami, the Hat and the Book Traveler.

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:56.500
Please enjoy the next story as well.
